    "name": "Territors",
    "steam_appid": 3470920,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/b974dcaf12fc8acd347f6e78bc1c9380.avif?t=1746305363\" width=600 height=125 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The quick card game of atomic energy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the microscopic world of particles with Protons &amp; Neutrons an exciting card game where atomic power collide! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take control of Proton and Neutron factions, competing to unlock all the cards by winning intense matches. With each victory, you'll have a chance to unlock new cards, build stronger factions, and face increasingly challenging enemies in this thrilling race for atomic supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be quick and easy to pick up, offering a thrilling experience without being time-consuming. Each match is fast-paced, making it perfect for shorter sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/88c5c18cdba2966f8b6ccf1b055112f0.avif?t=1746305363\" width=600 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a drag-and-drop system, allowing players to combine cards in countless ways, each with unique advantages based on their abilities, unique card powers and bonuses, enemy special traits, and a dynamic inventory size that adjusts based on your performance, enabling players to strategize and customize their decks for maximum impact.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game itself offers great replayability thanks to:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple dynamic card categories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/f63653cad558f5d0013e6cb26df83605.poster.avif?t=1746305363\" width=224 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/f63653cad558f5d0013e6cb26df83605.webm?t=1746305363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/f63653cad558f5d0013e6cb26df83605.mp4?t=1746305363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/481229522325be7142896277bb13a931.poster.avif?t=1746305363\" width=224 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/481229522325be7142896277bb13a931.webm?t=1746305363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/481229522325be7142896277bb13a931.mp4?t=1746305363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each</strong> <strong>card</strong> comes with a variety of dynamic attributes, including <strong>attack</strong> power, <strong>defense</strong> power, <strong>value</strong>, multiple <strong>abilities</strong>, <strong>bonuses</strong>, <strong>size</strong>, and <strong>level</strong>. Its performance can be optimized, and its role within the deck can be adjusted accordingly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Distinct factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction has its own strengths, weaknesses, and playstyle, offering fresh strategic choices each time you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic enemy growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow stronger, so does your enemy. The challenge continuously escalates, keeping you on your toes as the stakes rise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemy multiple difficulty levels and traits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/2993ffec01cd03c1546b3533e177927d.poster.avif?t=1746305363\" width=310 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/2993ffec01cd03c1546b3533e177927d.webm?t=1746305363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/2993ffec01cd03c1546b3533e177927d.mp4?t=1746305363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can <strong>scale</strong> in <strong>difficulty</strong>, allowing you to face off against different levels of enemies. The enemy has access to various <strong>traits</strong>, challenging you to constantly adapt and rethink your strategies with every encounter. To make things even more difficult, they can combine these abilities, making them even tougher to defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomized card unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new game offers a different order of card unlocks, creating a unique experience every time you play.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/b974dcaf12fc8acd347f6e78bc1c9380.avif?t=1746305363\" width=600 height=125 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The quick card game of atomic energy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the microscopic world of particles with Protons &amp; Neutrons an exciting card game where atomic power collide! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take control of Proton and Neutron factions, competing to unlock all the cards by winning intense matches. With each victory, you'll have a chance to unlock new cards, build stronger factions, and face increasingly challenging enemies in this thrilling race for atomic supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be quick and easy to pick up, offering a thrilling experience without being time-consuming. Each match is fast-paced, making it perfect for shorter sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/88c5c18cdba2966f8b6ccf1b055112f0.avif?t=1746305363\" width=600 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a drag-and-drop system, allowing players to combine cards in countless ways, each with unique advantages based on their abilities, unique card powers and bonuses, enemy special traits, and a dynamic inventory size that adjusts based on your performance, enabling players to strategize and customize their decks for maximum impact.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game itself offers great replayability thanks to:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple dynamic card categories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline pos