tronger, so does your enemy. The challenge continuously escalates, keeping you on your toes as the stakes rise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemy multiple difficulty levels and traits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/2993ffec01cd03c1546b3533e177927d.poster.avif?t=1746305363\" width=310 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/2993ffec01cd03c1546b3533e177927d.webm?t=1746305363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470920/extras/2993ffec01cd03c1546b3533e177927d.mp4?t=1746305363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can <strong>scale</strong> in <strong>difficulty</strong>, allowing you to face off against different levels of enemies. The enemy has access to various <strong>traits</strong>, challenging you to constantly adapt and rethink your strategies with every encounter. To make things even more difficult, they can combine these abilities, making them even tougher to defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomized card unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new game offers a different order of card unlocks, creating a unique experience every time you play.</p>",
